# ============== LEDs ==============
# The Odin 3 DTS declares compatible = "heroic,htr3212" for its RGB controller.
# Without this the node never probes and there is no RGB at all -- it was simply
# missing from this series, not deliberately dropped.
0030-leds-Add-driver-for-HEROIC-HTR3212.patch

