# DROPPED: 0013-add-force-feedback.patch
# Adds rumble to the RETROID RP5 gamepad — it patches drivers/input/joystick/
# retroid.c and drivers/input/misc/qcom-spmi-haptics.c, neither of which exists
# unless you also carry the SM8250 patches 0008-retroid-gamepad and
# 0009-qcom-spmi-haptics. The Odin 3 uses the RSInput gamepad (0031) and
# qcom-hv-haptics (1000) instead, so this is dead weight for a different device.

